es.cryptocompare.com/news/65/54993160.jpeg', 'TITLE': 'Here Is First Fib Level to Secure for Bitcoin to Reach $107,000', 'SUBTITLE': None, 'AUTHORS': 'Albert Brown', 'URL': 'https://thecryptobasic.com/2025/11/27/here-is-first-fib-level-to-secure-for-bitcoin-to-reach-107000/', 'SOURCE_ID': 65, 'BODY': 'The recent Bitcoin rebound has revealed the first resistance the crypto asset must reclaim before any sustained bullish continuation. Bitcoin is staging a comeback after bears exposed it to the $80,000 support zone. Visit Website', 'KEYWORDS': 'Analysis|Bitcoin Price Prediction|Latest Bitcoin (BTC) News Today', 'LANG': 'EN', 'UPVOTES': 0, 'DOWNVOTES': 0, 'SCORE': 0, 'SENTIMENT': 'POSITIVE', 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 'CREATED_ON': 1764251518, 'UPDATED_ON': 1764251519, 'SOURCE_DATA': {'TYPE': '120', 'ID': 65, 'SOURCE_KEY': 'thecryptobasic', 'NAME': 'The Crypto Basic', 'IMAGE_URL': 'https://images.cryptocompare.com/news/default/thecryptobasic.png', 'URL': 'https://thecryptobasic.com/category/latest-crypto-news/feed/', 'LANG': 'EN', 'SOURCE_TYPE': 'RSS', 'LAUNCH_DATE': None, 'SORT_ORDER': 0, 'BENCHMARK_SCORE': 0, 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 'LAST_UPDATED_TS': 1764250979, 'CREATED_ON': 1657730129, 'UPDATED_ON': 1673258252}, 'CATEGORY_DATA': [{'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 14, 'NAME': 'BTC', 'CATEGORY': 'BTC'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 37, 'NAME': 'MARKET', 'CATEGORY': 'MARKET'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 50, 'NAME': 'TRADING', 'CATEGORY': 'TRADING'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 211, 'NAME': 'CRYPTOCURRENCY', 'CATEGORY': 'CRYPTOCURRENCY'}]}, {'TYPE': '121', 'ID': 54993755, 'GUID': 'https://www.cryptopolitan.com/?p=869150', 'PUBLISHED_ON': 1764251337, 'PUBLISHED_ON_NS': None, 'IMAGE_URL': 'https://resources.cryptocompare.com/news/43/54993755.jpeg', 'TITLE': 'Capital.com credits crypto for Q3 trading volume rise to $755 million', 'SUBTITLE': None, 'AUTHORS': 'Lara Abdul Malak', 'URL': 'https://www.cryptopolitan.com/capital-com-crypto-investments-growth-mena/', 'SOURCE_ID': 43, 'BODY': 'UAE-regulated Capital.com, a global trading platform, reported that of its Q3 trading volumes of $755 million, crypto contributed to 51% of that total, and as such, the company has expanded its crypto offering to MENA. According to Capital.com, crypto trading led the surge in its Q3 report, climbing 53.9% quarter-on-quarter worldwide and an exceptional 67% month-on-month in MENA, reflecting the region’s growing appetite for digital assets. As per the press release, the company has added over 1,200 new markets, bringing the total number of instruments it offers traders to 5,000, including a significantly expanded range of crypto CFDs. Equities also advanced by 5.2% globally, driven by sustained investor interest in AI and technology stocks, while FX and commodities experienced seasonal declines. Capital.com doubles down on crypto Capital.com now offers over 400 crypto CFD instruments, including Bitcoin, Ethereum and other altcoins. “Digital assets are transforming the trading landscape globally, and MENA is at the forefront of this shift,” said Vitalii Kedyk, Head of Digital Assets, Capital.com. Tarik Chebib, CEO MENA at Capital.com, added that the UAE and MENA region are experiencing robust growth in digital trading. He added , “Our Q3 numbers reflect strong momentum, particularly in crypto, which grew by more than 67% quarter-on-quarter in MENA alone.” The interest in crypto has been growing in the MENA region , with sovereign wealth funds investing in Bitcoin ETFs. Both the Abu Dhabi Investment Council (ADIC), owned by Mubadala, a sovereign wealth fund, and Mubadala itself have invested in BlackRock’s iShares Bitcoin Trust ETF. Both entities have purchased more than 16 million shares, according to regulatory filings. Additionally, in a recent Avaloq report, the Avaloq wealth insights 2025 report, built on two surveys carried out earlier in 2025, in February and March, with over 3,851 investors from 15 markets, including the UAE, found that 39% of UAE investors hold crypto, surpassing the global average of 30%. Get $50 free to trade crypto when you sign up to Bybit now', 'KEYWORDS': 'News|BTC|Capitalcom|ETH|GCC', 'LANG': 'EN', 'UPVOTES': 0, 'DOWNVOTES': 0, 'SCORE': 0, 'SENTIMENT': 'POSITIVE', 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 'CREATED_ON': 1764252372, 'UPDATED_ON': 1764253653, 'SOURCE_DATA': {'TYPE': '120', 'ID': 43, 'SOURCE_KEY': 'cryptopolitan', 'NAME': 'Cryptopolitan', 'IMAGE_URL': 'https://images.cryptocompare.com/news/default/cryptopolitan.png', 'URL': 'https://www.cryptopolitan.com/feed/', 'LANG': 'EN', 'SOURCE_TYPE': 'RSS', 'LAUNCH_DATE': None, 'SORT_ORDER': 0, 'BENCHMARK_SCORE': 0, 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 'LAST_UPDATED_TS': 1764250951, 'CREATED_ON': 1657730129, 'UPDATED_ON': 1681205909}, 'CATEGORY_DATA': [{'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 14, 'NAME': 'BTC', 'CATEGORY': 'BTC'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 15, 'NAME': 'BUSINESS', 'CATEGORY': 'BUSINESS'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 24, 'NAME': 'ETH', 'CATEGORY': 'ETH'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 50, 'NAME': 'TRADING', 'CATEGORY': 'TRADING'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 211, 'NAME': 'CRYPTOCURRENCY', 'CATEGORY': 'CRYPTOCURRENCY'}]}, {'TYPE': '121', 'ID': 54993130, 'GUID': 'https://en.coinotag.com/breakingnews/bitcoin-etf-bitwise-ibit-profit-rebounds-to-3-2b-as-bitcoin-surges-past-90000', 'PUBLISHED_ON': 1764251208, 'PUBLISHED_ON_NS': None, 'IMAGE_URL': 'https://resources.cryptocompare.com/news/77/54993130.jpeg', 'TITLE': 'Bitcoin ETF Bitwise IBIT Profit Rebounds to $3.2B as Bitcoin Surges Past $90,000', 'SUBTITLE': None, 'AUTHORS': 'COINOTAG Editorial Team', 'URL': 'https://en.coinotag.com/breakingnews/bitcoin-etf-bitwise-ibit-profit-rebounds-to-3-2b-as-bitcoin-surges-past-90000', 'SOURCE_ID': 77, 'BODY': 'Bitcoin ETF Bitwise IBIT Profit Rebounds to $3.2B as Bitcoin Surges Past $90,000', 'KEYWORDS': 'Breaking News', 'LANG': 'EN', 'UPVOTES': 0, 'DOWNVOTES': 0, 'SCORE': 0, 'SENTIMENT': 'POSITIVE', 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 'CREATED_ON': 1764251442, 'UPDATED_ON': 1764251443, 'SOURCE_DATA': {'TYPE': '120', 'ID': 77, 'SOURCE_KEY': 'coinotag', 'NAME': 'CoinOtag', 'IMAGE_URL': 'https://resources.cryptocompare.com/news/77/default.png', 'URL': 'https://en.coinotag.com/feed/', 'LANG': 'EN', 'SOURCE_TYPE': 'RSS', 'LAUNCH_DATE': None, 'SORT_ORDER': 0, 'BENCHMARK_SCORE': 0, 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 'LAST_UPDATED_TS': 1764250991, 'CREATED_ON': 1686819961, 'UPDATED_ON': 1717748924}, 'CATEGORY_DATA': [{'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 14, 'NAME': 'BTC', 'CATEGORY': 'BTC'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 15, 'NAME': 'BUSINESS', 'CATEGORY': 'BUSINESS'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 211, 'NAME': 'CRYPTOCURRENCY', 'CATEGORY': 'CRYPTOCURRENCY'}]}, {'TYPE': '121', 'ID': 54992970, 'GUID': 'https://news.bitcoin.com/?p=773715', 'PUBLISHED_ON': 1764251144, 'PUBLISHED_ON_NS': None, 'IMAGE_URL': 'https://resources.cryptocompare.com/news/14/54992970.jpeg', 'TITLE': 'Bitcoin Price Watch: Momentum Builds Below Resistance', 'SUBTITLE': None, 'AUTHORS': 'Jamie Redman', 'URL': 'https://news.bitcoin.com/bitcoin-price-watch-momentum-builds-below-resistance/', 'SOURCE_ID': 14, 'BODY': 'Bitcoin is flirting with fresh highs, trading between $90,658 to $91,394 after brushing up against a $91,849 peak in the past 24 hours. With a market capitalization of $1.823 trillion and a roaring 24-hour trading volume of $77.09 billion, the asset is straddling a narrow range between $86,448 and its latest high, suggesting momentum is', 'KEYWORDS': 'News|Bitcoin (BTC)|Bitcoin Price|markets and prices', 'LANG': 'EN', 'UPVOTES': 0, 'DOWNVOTES': 0, 'SCORE': 0, 'SENTIMENT': 'POSITIVE', 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 'CREATED_ON': 1764251277, 'UPDATED_ON': 1764251278, 'SOURCE_DATA': {'TYPE': '120', 'ID': 14, 'SOURCE_KEY': 'bitcoin.com', 'NAME': 'Bitcoin.com', 'IMAGE_URL': 'https://images.cryptocompare.com/news/default/bitcoincom.png', 'URL': 'https://news.bitcoin.com/feed/', 'LANG': 'EN', 'SOURCE_TYPE': 'RSS', 'LAUNCH_DATE': 1438387200, 'SORT_ORDER': 0, 'BENCHMARK_SCORE': 51, 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 'LAST_UPDATED_TS': 1764250933, 'CREATED_ON': 1657730129, 'UPDATED_ON': 1711621233}, 'CATEGORY_DATA': [{'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 14, 'NAME': 'BTC', 'CATEGORY': 'BTC'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 37, 'NAME': 'MARKET', 'CATEGORY': 'MARKET'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 50, 'NAME': 'TRADING', 'CATEGORY': 'TRADING'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 211, 'NAME': 'CRYPTOCURRENCY', 'CATEGORY': 'CRYPTOCURRENCY'}]}, {'TYPE': '121', 'ID': 54993616, 'GUID': 'https://invezz.com/?p=2982665', 'PUBLISHED_ON': 1764250943, 'PUBLISHED_ON_NS': None, 'IMAGE_URL': 'https://resources.cryptocompare.com/news/69/default.png', 'TITLE': 'Kaspa price prediction: this pattern breakout and whale accumulation point to bullish shift', 'SUBTITLE': None, 'AUTHORS': 'Charles Thuo', 'URL': 'https://invezz.com/news/2025/11/27/kaspa-price-prediction-this-pattern-breakout-and-whale-accumulation-point-to-bullish-shift/', 'SOURCE_ID': 69, 'BODY': 'Kaspa (KAS) has seen a notable shift in market dynamics, with its price showing strong upward momentum after an extended period of stagnation. The Kaspa price is currently around $0.0615, marking a 21% increase over the past 24 hours and a remarkable 44% gain over the past week, although it still faces a long-term decline of nearly 59% over the year. This sharp rally signals the potential for a bullish shift, driven by both technical breakout and significant whale activity. Falling wedge breakout fuels momentum Recently, KAS has been trading within a descending channel pattern, which has historically acted as a bearish constraint, limiting upward moves for months. Kaspa has finally broken above the channel’s upper trendline, signaling a potential trend reversal. Kaspa price analysis | Source: TradingView The breakout was confirmed on both daily and multi-week charts, as KAS surged past key resistance levels, including the $0.060 psychological mark. Momentum indicators, such as the RSI and MACD, reflect strong upward pressure, while the Parabolic SAR has flipped bullish, reinforcing the idea that short-term sentiment is turning positive. Traders should now closely watch whether KAS can maintain gains above the $0.062 level, which is critical for a sustained breakout. Whale accumulation drives price resilience Alongside technical patterns, on-chain activity points to strong whale accumulation supporting Kaspa’s rally. According to Kaspa Builders, several major wallets have been buying aggressively, with the top holders collectively acquiring over 35 million KAS. Kaspa Builders @KaspaBuilders · Follow 🚨 Big wallets are buying the dip — aggressively. 🚨While the market is shaking out weak hands, the top $KAS holders are quietly loading up millions of coins.Looking at the on-chain data in this snapshot:• Rank #164 wallet: +9,000,000 KAS• Rank #8 wallet: +6,571,183 KAS 1:27 PM · Nov 25, 2025 155 Reply Copy link Read 3 replies This coordinated accumulation has been especially evident during periods when the KAS price hovered near $0.050, effectively establishing a floor and signaling confidence from long-term investors. The presence of these large wallets adds an extra layer of market stability, suggesting that the recent surge is backed by fundamental buying rather than purely speculative momentum. Kaspa Builders has also highlighted that the recent breakout from a multi-day accumulation zone was accompanied by high trading volume and clean price action, reinforcing the credibility of the move. The combination of strong technical signals, including a rising RSI and bullish Ichimoku cloud flip, with whale accumulation, suggests that KAS may have entered a new phase of sustained upward pressure. Kaspa price forecast Looking ahead, the Kaspa price forecast appears cautiously optimistic as the larger crypto market led by Bitcoin (BTC) recovers from the recent dip . If KAS can hold above the current breakout level and maintain support around $0.055–$0.057, the next targets are likely $0.065 and beyond, with Fibonacci extensions pointing toward a potential move as high as $0.079. Technical indicators such as the DMI and ADX also confirm strong momentum, suggesting that the bullish trend is part of a sustained move rather than a minor fluctuation. Conversely, a failure to defend these support levels could trigger profit-taking, with analysts pointing to $0.0515 as the immediate support level in case the main support around $0.055–$0.057 breaks. The post Kaspa price prediction: this pattern breakout and whale accumulation point to bullish shift appeared first on Invezz', 'KEYWORDS': 'Crypto|Crypto business|Kaspa', 'LANG': 'EN', 'UPVOTES': 0, 'DOWNVOTES': 0, 'SCORE': 0, 'SENTIMENT': 'POSITIVE', 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 'CREATED_ON': 1764252157, 'UPDATED_ON': None, 'SOURCE_DATA': {'TYPE': '120', 'ID': 69, 'SOURCE_KEY': 'invezz', 'NAME': 'Invezz', 'IMAGE_URL': 'https://resources.cryptocompare.com/news/69/default.png', 'URL': 'https://invezz.com/news/cryptocurrency/feed/', 'LANG': 'EN', 'SOURCE_TYPE': 'RSS', 'LAUNCH_DATE': None, 'SORT_ORDER': 0, 'BENCHMARK_SCORE': 0, 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 'LAST_UPDATED_TS': 1764250964, 'CREATED_ON': 1679069939, 'UPDATED_ON': 1679076581}, 'CATEGORY_DATA': [{'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 14, 'NAME': 'BTC', 'CATEGORY': 'BTC'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 15, 'NAME': 'BUSINESS', 'CATEGORY': 'BUSINESS'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 37, 'NAME': 'MARKET', 'CATEGORY': 'MARKET'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 50, 'NAME': 'TRADING', 'CATEGORY': 'TRADING'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 211, 'NAME': 'CRYPTOCURRENCY', 'CATEGORY': 'CRYPTOCURRENCY'}]}, {'TYPE': '121', 'ID': 54992886, 'GUID': 'https://cointelegraph.com/news/how-blockchain-upgrades-start-from-idea-to-proposal?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound', 'PUBLISHED_ON': 1764250920, 'PUBLISHED_ON_NS': None, 'IMAGE_URL': 'https://images.cryptocompare.com/news/default/cointelegraph.png', 'TITLE': 'How blockchain upgrades start: From idea to proposal', 'SUBTITLE': None, 'AUTHORS': 'Cointelegraph by Ayse Karaman', 'URL': 'https://cointelegraph.com/news/how-blockchain-upgrades-start-from-idea-to-proposal?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound', 'SOURCE_ID': 16, 'BODY': 'CTDG Dev Hub’s upgrade pipeline turns raw ideas into tested code, formal proposals and transparent governance across networks.', 'KEYWORDS': '', 'LANG': 'EN', 'UPVOTES': 0, 'DOWNVOTES': 0, 'SCORE': 0, 'SENTIMENT': 'POSITIVE', 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 'CREATED_ON': 1764251101, 'UPDATED_ON': None, 'SOURCE_DATA': {'TYPE': '120', 'ID': 16, 'SOURCE_KEY': 'cointelegraph', 'NAME': 'Cointelegraph', 'IMAGE_URL': 'https://images.cryptocompare.com/news/default/cointelegraph.png', 'URL': 'https://cointelegraph.com/rss', 'LANG': 'EN', 'SOURCE_TYPE': 'RSS', 'LAUNCH_DATE': 1382054400, 'SORT_ORDER': 0, 'BENCHMARK_SCORE': 0, 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 'LAST_UPDATED_TS': 1764250948, 'CREATED_ON': 1657730129, 'UPDATED_ON': 1760450177}, 'CATEGORY_DATA': [{'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 13, 'NAME': 'BLOCKCHAIN', 'CATEGORY': 'BLOCKCHAIN'}]}, {'TYPE': '121', 'ID': 54992885, 'GUID': 'https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-etfs-break-streak-xrp-etfs-shine-doge-etfs-stumble?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound', 'PUBLISHED_ON': 1764250835, 'PUBLISHED_ON_NS': None, 'IMAGE_URL': 'https://images.cryptocompare.com/news/default/cointelegraph.png', 'TITLE': 'Solana ETFs end perfect run as 21Shares’ TSOL sees $34M in outflows', 'SUBTITLE': None, 'AUTHORS': 'Cointelegraph by Ezra Reguerra', 'URL': 'https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-etfs-break-streak-xrp-etfs-shine-doge-etfs-stumble?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound', 'SOURCE_ID': 16, 'BODY': 'The reversal was driven by the 21Shares Solana ETF (TSOL), which saw over $34 million in withdrawals in a single day.', 'KEYWORDS': '', 'LANG': 'EN', 'UPVOTES': 0, 'DOWNVOTES': 0, 'SCORE': 0, 'SENTIMENT': 'NEGATIVE', 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 'CREATED_ON': 1764251100, 'UPDATED_ON': 1764251555, 'SOURCE_DATA': {'TYPE': '120', 'ID': 16, 'SOURCE_KEY': 'cointelegraph', 'NAME': 'Cointelegraph', 'IMAGE_URL': 'https://images.cryptocompare.com/news/default/cointelegraph.png', 'URL': 'https://cointelegraph.com/rss', 'LANG': 'EN', 'SOURCE_TYPE': 'RSS', 'LAUNCH_DATE': 1382054400, 'SORT_ORDER': 0, 'BENCHMARK_SCORE': 0, 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 'LAST_UPDATED_TS': 1764250948, 'CREATED_ON': 1657730129, 'UPDATED_ON': 1760450177}, 'CATEGORY_DATA': [{'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 46, 'NAME': 'SOL', 'CATEGORY': 'SOL'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 211, 'NAME': 'CRYPTOCURRENCY', 'CATEGORY': 'CRYPTOCURRENCY'}]}, {'TYPE': '121', 'ID': 54992673, 'GUID': 'https://bitcoinworld.co.in/?p=223693', 'PUBLISHED_ON': 1764250811, 'PUBLISHED_ON_NS': None, 'IMAGE_URL': 'https://resources.cryptocompare.com/news/82/default.png', 'TITLE': 'Revolutionary NXPC Token Burn: Nexpace Destroys 3.84 Million Tokens in Strategic Move', 'SUBTITLE': None, 'AUTHORS': 'Editorial Team', 'URL': 'https://bitcoinworld.co.in/nexpace-nxpc-token-burn/', 'SOURCE_ID': 82, 'BODY': 'BitcoinWorld Revolutionary NXPC Token Burn: Nexpace Destroys 3.84 Million Tokens in Strategic Move In a groundbreaking move that’s shaking up the Web3 gaming space, Nexpace has executed its first major NXPC token burn, permanently removing 3.84 million tokens from circulation. This strategic decision marks a pivotal moment for the MapleStory Universe ecosystem and demonstrates Nexpace’s commitment to creating sustainable tokenomics. What Does This NXPC Token Burn Actually Mean? The recent NXPC token burn represents a deliberate reduction in total token supply. By destroying 3.84 million NXPC tokens, Nexpace effectively increases the scarcity of remaining tokens. This fundamental economic principle often leads to increased value for token holders through reduced inflation pressure. Token burning has become a popular mechanism in the cryptocurrency world for several key reasons: Supply reduction – Fewer tokens in circulation means each remaining token becomes more valuable Investor confidence – Shows project commitment to long-term sustainability Price stability – Helps combat inflation and maintain token value Community trust – Demonstrates transparent token management practices How Will This NXPC Token Burn Impact Investors? For current NXPC token holders, this token burn creates immediate positive implications. The reduced supply means your existing tokens now represent a larger percentage of the total ecosystem. Moreover, this strategic NXPC token burn signals strong project management and forward-thinking tokenomics. However, it’s crucial to understand that token burns alone don’t guarantee price appreciation. The success of any NXPC token burn strategy depends on continued project development, user adoption, and market conditions. Therefore, while this NXPC token burn is undoubtedly positive, investors should consider the broader ecosystem growth. Why Choose Token Burning Over Other Strategies? Nexpace selected the NXPC token burn approach for its transparency and immediate impact. Unlike complex staking mechanisms or locked vesting schedules, token burning provides clear, verifiable results that benefit all token holders equally. This NXPC token burn creates a deflationary effect that can help stabilize token value during market fluctuations. The decision to conduct this NXPC token burn also aligns with MapleStory Universe’s long-term vision. By carefully managing token supply, Nexpace ensures the ecosystem remains healthy and sustainable for years to come. This NXPC token burn represents just the beginning of their comprehensive token management strategy. What’s Next After This Initial NXPC Token Burn? Looking forward, this first NXPC token burn sets a precedent for future token management. The successful execution demonstrates Nexpace’s capability to implement deflationary mechanisms effectively. Consequently, we might see additional NXPC token burn events as the project evolves and generates more ecosystem revenue. The Web3 gaming space continues to evolve rapidly, and strategic moves like this NXPC token burn position Nexpace as an industry leader. As more players join the MapleStory Universe, the careful token supply management through mechanisms like this NXPC token burn will become increasingly important for maintaining ecosystem balance. Final Thoughts: A Strategic Move Worth Watching The 3.84 million NXPC token burn represents more than just numbers – it’s a statement of intent from the Nexpace team. This decisive action shows their commitment to building a sustainable Web3 gaming economy where token holders can genuinely benefit from ecosystem growth. The careful planning behind this NXPC token burn demonstrates sophisticated tokenomics understanding that should inspire confidence throughout the community. Frequently Asked Questions What exactly is a token burn? A token burn permanently removes cryptocurrency tokens from circulation by sending them to an inaccessible wallet address, effectively reducing total supply. How does the NXPC token burn benefit holders? The NXPC token burn increases scarcity of remaining tokens, which can potentially increase value and demonstrates project commitment to sustainable tokenomics. Will there be more NXPC token burns in the future? While not confirmed, the successful execution of this first NXPC token burn suggests it could become part of their ongoing token management strategy. How can I verify the NXPC token burn occurred? You can check the blockchain transaction where the tokens were sent to a burn address, providing transparent verification of the token destruction. Does token burning guarantee price increase? No, while token burning reduces supply and can support price appreciation, it doesn’t guarantee it as market factors and project development also play crucial roles. What makes this NXPC token burn different from others? This NXPC token burn is significant because it’s the first for the project and directly supports the growing MapleStory Universe Web3 ecosystem. Found this analysis of the NXPC token burn helpful? Share this article with fellow crypto enthusiasts and Web3 gaming community members to spread awareness about this important development! To learn more about the latest cryptocurrency trends, explore our article on key developments shaping Web3 gaming tokenomics and future price action. This post Revolutionary NXPC Token Burn: Nexpace Destroys 3.84 Million Tokens in Strategic Move first appeared on BitcoinWorld .', 'KEYWORDS': 'Crypto News|CRYPTOCURRENCY|MapleStory|NEXPACE|Token burn|Web3', 'LANG': 'EN', 'UPVOTES': 0, 'DOWNVOTES': 0, 'SCORE': 0, 'SENTIMENT': 'POSITIVE', 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 'CREATED_ON': 1764250839, 'UPDATED_ON': None, 'SOURCE_DATA': {'TYPE': '120', 'ID': 82, 'SOURCE_KEY': 'bitcoinworld', 'NAME': 'Bitcoin World', 'IMAGE_URL': 'https://resources.cryptocompare.com/news/82/default.png', 'URL': 'https://bitcoinworld.co.in/feed/', 'LANG': 'EN', 'SOURCE_TYPE': 'RSS', 'LAUNCH_DATE': None, 'SORT_ORDER': 0, 'BENCHMARK_SCORE': 0, 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 'LAST_UPDATED_TS': 1764250975, 'CREATED_ON': 1698066984, 'UPDATED_ON': 1747932437}, 'CATEGORY_DATA': [{'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 15, 'NAME': 'BUSINESS', 'CATEGORY': 'BUSINESS'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 37, 'NAME': 'MARKET', 'CATEGORY': 'MARKET'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 50, 'NAME': 'TRADING', 'CATEGORY': 'TRADING'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 210, 'NAME': 'MACROECONOMICS', 'CATEGORY': 'MACROECONOMICS'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 211, 'NAME': 'CRYPTOCURRENCY', 'CATEGORY': 'CRYPTOCURRENCY'}]}, {'TYPE': '121', 'ID': 54993660, 'GUID': 'https://en.coinotag.com/nasdaq-proposes-quadrupling-options-limits-for-blackrocks-bitcoin-etf', 'PUBLISHED_ON': 1764250575, 'PUBLISHED_ON_NS': None, 'IMAGE_URL': 'https://resources.cryptocompare.com/news/77/54993660.jpeg', 'TITLE': 'Nasdaq Proposes Quadrupling Options Limits for BlackRock’s Bitcoin ETF', 'SUBTITLE': None, 'AUTHORS': 'COINOTAG Editorial Team', 'URL': 'https://en.coinotag.com/nasdaq-proposes-quadrupling-options-limits-for-blackrocks-bitcoin-etf', 'SOURCE_ID': 77, 'BODY': \"Nasdaq's International Securities Exchange has proposed raising position limits for BlackRock's iShares Bitcoin Trust (IBIT) options from 250